                         Support and future versions
                         ---------------------------
  This program was tested as a part of Russian driver for more than six
months. The version with  support for all maps  was also tested.  Major
bugs were  fixed.  Of  course,  every  program  has  at  least  2  bugs
(programmer's axiom). If you find  any -- please, e-mail me  regardless
of whether you are a registered user or  not. If it will is a real  bug
you will receive an  updated version (maybe with  new features and  new
bugs).

  If you have any suggestions, please feel free to send them to me.  If
you decide that  some features would  be useful,   and others feel  the
same way, I'll try to implement them.


               If your language is not supported by Psion
               ------------------------------------------
  If your language
   - has no more than 128 letters and
   - they are not in cp850 and
   - you read and write from left to right
  it is possible to create a  package like the Russian driver for  your
language. Because this is  a big job  it will be  done only if  several
users are interested; it is better to contact your local official Psion
distributors to tell them about me.

  If you  already have  fonts for  your language  we can  arrange  this
question.

  Use of  KbdMap with  your own  fonts to  type Russian  characters  is
prohibited. See How to reach me and call me to give more info on how to
buy full Russian package.

  Special note: according to our  agreement I must mention that  Polhit
Ltd. has exclusive rights  to distribute the  driver, based on  KbdMap,
for Polish language.

